    <TD STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 0.25in">&#9679;</TD>
  <TD STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">any other terms of the rights, including the terms, procedures,
